            <div xml:id="d301">

                <pb facs="0410" n="338" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg338"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 871/20–23.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Moses to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-07-16"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6—Greek Series.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that the note of
                    the four protecting powers, in re the Cretan situation, was delivered at the
                    Greek ministry for foreign affairs on Tuesday, the 13th instant, and to inclose
                    a copy of the document, with an English translation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. H. Moses.</hi></signed></closer>





